  "description": "Brant & Co Property Consultants are offering a fantastic opportunity to rent a bright and well-presented 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom ground floor apartment in a highly convenient location at 21C Quay Street, Balbriggan.\n\nThis ground floor apartment offers comfortable and newly painted space and is ideally positioned within close walking distance to Balbriggan town centre, local shops, cafés, restaurants and transport links such as Balbriggan train station, and Dublin bus.\n\nA major benefit of the location is the newly completed Quay Street and Harbour regeneration project directly across the road. As part of Fingal County Council’s Our Balbriggan Rejuvenation Programme, the area has undergone a significant transformation, including upgraded public spaces, landscaping, improved pedestrian areas, new harbour facilities and enhanced connections towards the beach and harbour.\n\n21A Quay Street, therefore ideally positioned to enjoy the newly revitalised surroundings right on its doorstep.\n\nProperty features:\n\n1 double bedroom\n1 bathroom\nGround floor accommodation\nExcellent central location\nNewly regenerated Quay Street and Harbour area directly opposite\nClose to Balbriggan beach and harbour\nWalking distance to local shops, cafés and restaurants and cinema\nConvenient access to public transport including Balbriggan train station\n\nWith the extensive regeneration of the surrounding area now completed, this is an excellent opportunity to secure a home in one of Balbriggan’s newly revitalised areas.",
